description = "[PAWN_nameDef] was engineered in a lab as part of the G-nome Project. [PAWN_pronoun] was implanted at birth with encyclopedic knowledge of all aspects of xenobiology.

The G-nome scientists nicknamed [PAWN_objective] [PAWN_nameDef] and occupied [PAWN_objective] with sculpting. [PAWN_pronoun] developed a love of sculpting gnomes and gnome accessories."
